  "flavor_text": {
    "one_line": "Austere mountain dwarves who bind law, lineage, and craft into one unbroken oath.",
    "one_paragraph": "The Karag-Torum hold that a clan survives only when every oath is recorded, every debt repaid, and every hall kept in repair for descendants yet unborn. Their citadels are severe but magnificent, with gatehalls carved in the likeness of honored dead. They respect outsiders who keep their word, but trust slowly and punish betrayal with cold finality."
